---
name: simplify
version: 0.1.0
description: Beads formula for the simplification child of one dev or fix bead, attached under that bead. bead-groups supplies every variable.
format: toml
required_variables:
  - parent
  - phase
  - sprint
  - stack
  - difficulty
  - priority
  - branch
  - worktree
  - pr_target
  - simplifier
  - max_passes
---
{#
sc-compose beads formula (sc-compose/beads/v1): one simplify step, poured as
the child of the dev or fix bead it reviews (the attach parent). A child
blocks its parent's close, so the dev or fix bead cannot close until this
bead is closed: the review cannot be skipped. Poured id: parent.ref-simplify.

The dev or fix assignee runs the named simplifier agent (the phase file's
`simplifier`, default simplify-reviewer) as a background agent over its
diff before closing the parent, applies the removals that drop no
deliverable and no cited requirement, and closes this bead with the result.
At most max_passes passes (integer, written bare).
#}
formula = "simplify"
description = "Simplification of {{{ parent }}} (sprint {{{ sprint }}})."
version = 1
type = "workflow"

[[steps]]
id = "simplify"
title = "{{{ sprint }}}: simplify {{{ parent }}}"
description = "Before closing {{{ parent }}}, run {{{ simplifier }}} as a background agent over its diff from {{{ pr_target }}} with the parent's deliverables and cited requirements and ADRs. Apply each proposed removal that drops no deliverable and no cited requirement; record each rejected removal with the deliverable or requirement that needs it. At most {{{ max_passes }}} passes. Close this bead with the removals applied and rejected, then close the parent."
type = "task"
priority = {{{ priority }}}
labels = ["phase-{{{ phase }}}", "stack:{{{ stack }}}", "stage:simplify"]

[steps.metadata]
role = "simplify"
phase = "{{{ phase }}}"
sprint = "{{{ sprint }}}"
stack = "{{{ stack }}}"
difficulty = "{{{ difficulty }}}"
branch = "{{{ branch }}}"
worktree = "{{{ worktree }}}"
pr_target = "{{{ pr_target }}}"
checked_bead = "{{{ parent }}}"
simplifier = "{{{ simplifier }}}"
max_passes = {{{ max_passes }}}
